{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18267","headline":"自袁州还京行次安陆先寄随州周员外 · 韩愈","name":"自袁州还京行次安陆先寄随州周员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行行指汉东，暂喜笑言同。\n雨雪离江上，蒹葭出梦中。\n面犹含瘴色，眼已见华风。\n岁暮难相值，酣歌未可终。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}